==Event Information==
<!--Event Information based on reference, October 10th, 2025.-->
The Battle Cats has reached its {{Color|#FF9900|'''11th anniversary'''}}! A big thank you to everyone who has been with us since the beginning and those of you who jumped onboard at any point inbetween! We've got a ton of great rewards for everyone to celebrate 11 years of The Battle Cats!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from September 12th (11:00am) until October 27th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Grab a huge amount of Cat food for the 11th anniversary with Wildcat Slots!'''}}<br>
Get all XIs for huge Cat Food rewards!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from September 12th (11:00am) until September 24th (11:59pm)!'''}}<br>
Visit the Cat Base to try out the Wildcat Slots during this {{Color|#0000FF|'''special 11th anniversary'''}} event to earn prizes of at least {{Color|#FF0000|'''1011 Cat Food'''}}!

A huge haul of Cat Food awaits those ready to test their luck at the Wildcat Slots!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Several special offers come together at once!'''}}<br>
Get special perks for playing The Battle Cats for a limited time!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Half-Off Energy Cost for Empire, Future and Cosmos stages!'''}}<br>
During this event, the Cat Energy cost to challenge stages in the {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, {{Color|#34A853|'''Into the Future'''}}, or {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} will be half the normal cost each day during the times below!

{{Color|#FF0000|'''7:00am ~ 8:59am / 12:00pm ~ 1:59pm / 5:00pm ~ 6:59pm / 8:00pm ~ 9:59pm'''}}

※ If the Cat Energy reduction does not appear at the listed times above, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited Sale: Get Special Units for 50% off their usual Cat Food cost!'''}}<br>
Purchase Special units for half-off the normal Cat Food cost during the event to get through a tough stage!<br>
Complete your collection by taking advantage of this special offer!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Legend Ticket Sale for the 11th Anniversary!'''}}<br>
Purchase a Legend Ticket for a limited time during the event and collect an Uber Rare or above unit from the special Legend Capsules!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from September 22nd (11:00am) until October 27th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
※ Only one Legend Ticket can be purchased per person during the event.<br>
※If a Legend Ticket cannot be purchased, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.<br>
※Legend Capsules do not include seasonal units, collab units, limited units from Girls and Monsters, or limited units from other Rare Capsule sets.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Super Limited Unit: "Gacha Cat" ON SALE!'''}}<br>
Gacha Cat is now part of a special Gacha Cat Set on sale for the 11th anniversary and spinning more than ever! Grab one while you can!<br>
※ The Gacha Cat Set can only be purchased once per user account during the sale period.<br>
※ If you have previously purchased Gacha Cat during a past event, you may not purchase this sale pack again.<br>
※ If the Gacha Cat Sale fails to appear as scheduled, update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● 11th Anniversary stages on now!'''}}<br>
Earn Cat Tickets, battle items, and XP from anniversary stages!

Visit the Event Stages section of the Legend Stages to challenge these anniversary stages.

