{{Color|#FF9900|'''● 11th Anniversary Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Challenge the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''B-Day Gifts!'''}} map to earn a {{Color|#FF0000|'''20 Cat Food reward'''}} on your first clear each day.

