{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Catclaw Dojo Challenges'''}}<br>
Get your strongest soldiers of the Cat Army ready, the Dojo Ranking Event is here throughout the 11th Anniversary Campaign and it's time to prove yourself!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from September 26th (11:00am) until October 27th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
Visit the Catclaw Dojo during the event to access the Arena of Power! Clear stages to record your high score and compete with players around the world for the highest ranking! Earn better rewards for scoring higher ranks! Check the reward list in the top-right of the Catclaw Dojo to check the available rewards!

Expect even better rewards for the 11th anniversary!

※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!

