※ Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.

※ Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.

※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Dojo event scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.

※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.

※ If Dojo events do not appear even if the conditions are met, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

