==Trivia==
*The Cat Talk questionnaire that makes up Part 3 of this event is a reference to the marriage sequence in the original version of ''[https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Dragon_Quest_V:_Hand_of_the_Heavenly_Bride Dragon Quest V]'', where the player must choose to marry either [https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Bianca_Whitaker Bianca Whitaker] (the childhood friend) or [https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Nera_Briscoletti Nera Briscoletti] (the noble woman) in order to progress the story. The "small cat" mentioned in the childhood friend portion is a reference to [https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Saber Saber], a Great Sabercub that Bianca and the player character save from the harrasment of two little boys early on during the game's story. The "flame and water wedding rings" mentioned in the noble woman part reference the [https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Circle_of_Fire Circle of Fire] and [https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Circle_of_Water Circle of Water], two rings that the player must retrieve to prove they're worthy of Nera/Bianca's hand in marriage.

